.5771-25/491819407_1134130798661955_7898807991951626825_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qs9ldMTud0Q7kNvwEoEZZ-&_nc_oc=AdrVPir9lt_GJY83YUbtHbmnHlgdcs3GdjvTDSdM_ZYTbSKR5EA1Fba2GluP0L0KWfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7yCedOGyx-a9qpJqbOabChk3JaLIyouT4fkMDlQiU6Yg&oe=6A1C3E61"}, {"file_name": "Screen_2560x1440_9-24-2025 11.08.28 AM.png", "id": "820453097011332", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_820453100344665_1234126521579796332_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=72CxP3FbFgAQ7kNvwFe75t2&_nc_oc=Adq3QbMPF1L6sdfaXRqBaZyvAGIQKaVynyKUqgyYqhqgmm8pOCUPyZUAfdyiD44opyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af61rAgbv2BOV4vPGFhIGb-lLVB0Vuzr_5-dfLIHybRqbQ&oe=6A1C5307"}, {"file_name": "Screen_2560x1440_9-24-2025 11.05.11 AM.png", "id": "1429925808098656", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1429925811431989_5049061799786709208_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GzNW9eBADa0Q7kNvwHXmMoC&_nc_oc=AdodXDahUEN5Vhhbg5y0cmSMHRXmcP4YbwFxcj2TLeobUeHWb9dz9EMKzfmg2keuThQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7tNSfNQEEQKNqnVALRZsg-4d8nkJ5zMEqmsDVBHOYipQ&oe=6A1C43BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Crew Together XR", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "teamdevelopment", "teambuilding", "communication", "game"], "long_description": "Step into immersive XR missions that strengthen communication, trust, and collaboration. Crew Together XR combines the excitement of a game experience with proven team development methods \u2014 available for cross-play on tablets, smartphones, and VR headsets.\n\n**Try our XR tutorial and free demo right away.**\n\n**What\u2019s inside**\n- More than a game: Guided team missions with structured reflection \u2014 experience, analyze, and grow together.\n- Learning through experience: Challenges reveal how your team communicates, makes decisions, and adapts under pressure.\n- Four immersive missions: Explore themes like trust, stress, perspective-taking, and conflict in varied team scenarios.\n- Flexible use cases: Suitable for project kickoffs, onboarding, leadership training, or apprenticeships.\n- Proven impact: Developed with professional coaches and tested with teams, leaders, and future talents.\n\nCrew Together XR is your entry point to next-generation team development. Whether you are leading, learning, or facilitating \u2014 this experience helps your teams build the skills that matter most.\n\n**Download Crew Together XR today and start with the free demo and tutorial.**\n", "short_description": "Crew Together XR blends immersive game experiences with guided reflection to boost communication, trust, and collaboration. \n\nTry the free demo and tutorial today."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Quest Title (Portrait).png", "id": "1879996865912788", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822817_1879996869246121_6848932406799711648_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TV1tVlOO81QQ7kNvwFbElds&_nc_oc=AdqX2DSLQC65_Fw5iDHSC7y_9ICur6PLCascfPGhKJ_XdxbLiiI8Ur7Sz_YH2FodOjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6rZynpsvqo4xpYrLZHzban8uSJQt5xDLgxmpxWQHQYNg&oe=6A1C568C"}, {"file_name": "Quest Title (Square).png", "id": "1879487672962406", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_1879487676295739_5728607241010560823_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xH1S_hiVkB8Q7kNvwFhlsiF&_nc_oc=AdoFYkqSRyfBOdb0FLpRHrI4gulzSMW-NgOBpccxxoTbtKI3rpo7PiVu5qVLWdhwyic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5L3DV86pZfNbKlIvFzegWOiEfdHMvcjurIq08orGlLQg&oe=6A1C5BFC"}, {"file_name": "Quest Title - landscape.png", "id": "1540179927169516", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent