s \u2014 available for cross-play on tablets, smartphones, and VR headsets.\n\n**Try our XR tutorial and free demo right away.**\n\n**What\u2019s inside**\n- More than a game: Guided team missions with structured reflection \u2014 experience, analyze, and grow together.\n- Learning through experience: Challenges reveal how your team communicates, makes decisions, and adapts under pressure.\n- Four immersive missions: Explore themes like trust, stress, perspective-taking, and conflict in varied team scenarios.\n- Flexible use cases: Suitable for project kickoffs, onboarding, leadership training, or apprenticeships.\n- Proven impact: Developed with professional coaches and tested with teams, leaders, and future talents.\n\nCrew Together XR is your entry point to next-generation team development. Whether you are leading, learning, or facilitating \u2014 this experience helps your teams build the skills that matter most.\n\n**Download Crew Together XR today and start with the free demo and tutorial.**\n", "short_description": "Crew Together XR blends immersive game experiences with guided reflection to boost communication, trust, and collaboration. \n\nTry the free demo and tutorial today."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Quest Title (Portrait).png", "id": "1879996865912788", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822817_1879996869246121_6848932406799711648_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TV1tVlOO81QQ7kNvwFbElds&_nc_oc=AdqX2DSLQC65_Fw5iDHSC7y_9ICur6PLCascfPGhKJ_XdxbLiiI8Ur7Sz_YH2FodOjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6rZynpsvqo4xpYrLZHzban8uSJQt5xDLgxmpxWQHQYNg&oe=6A1C568C"}, {"file_name": "Quest Title (Square).png", "id": "1879487672962406", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_1879487676295739_5728607241010560823_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xH1S_hiVkB8Q7kNv